{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24685","headline":"每见吕南二郎中新文辄窃有所叹惜因成长句以咏所怀 · 白居易","name":"每见吕南二郎中新文辄窃有所叹惜因成长句以咏所怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"双金百链少人知，纵我知君徒尔爲。\n望梅合老无妨渴，画饼尚书不救饥。\n白日回头看又晚，青云举足蹑何迟。\n壮年可惜虚销掷，遣把闲杯吟咏诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24685.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24685","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}